                    <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/M4MJnxSZbpL4fHmo6" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-500 font-semibold hover:underline flex items-center justify-center gap-2 lang-text" data-id="Lihat Semua 50+ Ulasan di Google Maps →" data-en="View All 50+ Reviews on Google Maps →">
                        Lihat Semua 50+ Ulasan di Google Maps →
                    </a>
